      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "我が輩はダグザの東海を巡る商いをしておる者だが\n海賊の被害が酷くてな……武装商船を新造したのだ。\nその出港式の景気づけに、曲と共に舞を興じたい。\n勇壮なものが良いな。頼んだぞ！",
        "official_en": "I'm a merchant who sails Dagda's eastern seas, and\nin response to the pirates plaguing us, I decided to\ncreate an armored merchant vessel. Would someone\ndance to a heroic melody for the launching ceremony?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
