      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "諸君のおかげで最高の出港式となった！\nヴァンダル商会の連中にも見せつけてやったわい。\nこれから我が輩の船が海賊どもを蹴散らして\nがっぽり稼ぐさまを見せつけてやる！　がっはっは！",
        "official_en": "The launching ceremony was excellent! Enough to\nmake even the Vandahl Trading Company envious!\nHa! With my new armored ship, I'm going to crush\nthose pirates and make an absolute killing.",
        "real_en": null
